## Intelligence Layer: Continuous Learning v2

**Diagram: Learning Pipeline**

```mermaid
graph LR
    subgraph "Observation"
        ToolUse["Tool use events<br/>(Edit, Write, Read, Bash)"]
        ObserveHook["scripts/hooks/observe.sh"]
        ProjectID["detect-project.sh<br/>SHA-256 project hash"]
        ObsFile["~/.claude/homunculus/projects/<br/>{project-id}/observations.jsonl"]
    end
    
    subgraph "Analysis"
        Observer["start-observer.sh daemon"]
        Haiku["Claude Haiku API<br/>Pattern detection"]
        Threshold["min_observations_to_analyze<br/>(default: 20)"]
    end
    
    subgraph "Codification"
        Instincts["instincts/personal/<br/>{project-id}/*.md"]
        Confidence["confidence: 0.3-0.85<br/>(frequency-based)"]
        Scope["project vs global"]
    end
    
    subgraph "Evolution"
        Commands["/instinct-status<br/>/promote<br/>/evolve"]
        Cluster["Cluster related instincts"]
        GenSkills["skills/evolved/<br/>Generated SKILL.md"]
    end
    
    ToolUse --> ObserveHook
    ObserveHook --> ProjectID
    ProjectID --> ObsFile
    ObsFile --> Observer
    Observer --> Haiku
    Haiku --> Threshold
    Threshold --> Instincts
    Instincts --> Confidence
    Instincts --> Scope
    Scope --> Commands
    Commands --> Cluster
    Cluster --> GenSkills
```

The continuous learning system implements a closed feedback loop:

1. **Observation Phase** - `scripts/hooks/observe.sh` captures tool use events in project-scoped `observations.jsonl` files
2. **Analysis Phase** - Background `start-observer.sh` daemon uses Claude Haiku to detect patterns when threshold reached (20+ observations)
3. **Codification Phase** - Generates instinct files with YAML frontmatter, confidence scores (0.3-0.85), and markdown content
4. **Evolution Phase** - `/evolve` command clusters related instincts into full skills, `/promote` moves project instincts to global scope

This creates compound learning effects where each session improves future sessions.

**Sources:** [README.md:89-117](), [README.md:451-462](), Diagram 3 from context

