## Component Validation

ECC includes comprehensive validation scripts in `tests/`:

- `validate-agents.js` - Frontmatter, model, tools validation
- `validate-skills.js` - SKILL.md existence, YAML structure
- `validate-commands.js` - Cross-references to agents/skills
- `validate-hooks.js` - JSON schema, inline JavaScript syntax
- `validate-rules.js` - Non-empty files, valid markdown

These run in CI to prevent regressions.

