This page documents the installation process, verification steps, and initial usage of the everything-claude-code plugin. The installation process involves adding the plugin marketplace, installing the plugin, and manually copying rules files that cannot be distributed via the plugin system.

See page 1 for plugin overview. See page 3 for architectural concepts. See page 4 for comprehensive installation and configuration options.

---

## Installation Methods

Two installation methods are available: marketplace-based installation (automated) and manual installation (component-by-component control).

### Option 1: Marketplace Installation

**Marketplace Installation Flow:**

```mermaid
graph TB
    Start["Execute command in Claude Code"] --> AddCmd["/plugin marketplace add<br/>affaan-m/everything-claude-code"]
    AddCmd --> SettingsUpdate["Updates ~/.claude/settings.json<br/>extraKnownMarketplaces field"]
    SettingsUpdate --> OpenPlugins["/plugins command"]
    OpenPlugins --> UINav["Navigate to everything-claude-code<br/>in marketplaces tab"]
    UINav --> InstallBtn["Click Install button"]
    InstallBtn --> PluginEnable["Adds to enabledPlugins<br/>in settings.json"]
    PluginEnable --> LoadManifest["Loads .claude-plugin/plugin.json"]
    LoadManifest --> LoadComponents["Loads declared components:<br/>commands/, agents/, skills/"]
    LoadComponents --> LoadHooks["Auto-loads hooks/hooks.json<br/>(by convention, not declaration)"]
    LoadHooks --> ManualRules["MANUAL STEP REQUIRED:<br/>Copy rules/ to ~/.claude/rules/"]
```

**Installation Commands:**

```bash
# Step 1: Add marketplace
/plugin marketplace add affaan-m/everything-claude-code

# Step 2: Install via UI (/plugins) or edit settings.json directly
```

**Direct settings.json Configuration:**

```json
{
  "extraKnownMarketplaces": {
    "everything-claude-code": {
      "source": {
        "source": "github",
        "repo": "affaan-m/everything-claude-code"
      }
    }
  },
  "enabledPlugins": {
    "everything-claude-code@everything-claude-code": true
  }
}
```

**Rules Installation (Required Manual Step):**

The Claude Code plugin system does not support distributing files to `~/.claude/rules/` directory. Rules must be copied manually:

```bash
# Clone repository
git clone https://github.com/affaan-m/everything-claude-code.git

# Copy rules to user-level rules directory
cp -r everything-claude-code/rules/* ~/.claude/rules/

# Alternatively, copy to project-level rules directory
mkdir -p .claude/rules
cp -r everything-claude-code/rules/* .claude/rules/
```

This installs six rule files: `security.md`, `coding-style.md`, `testing.md`, `git-workflow.md`, `agents.md`, `performance.md`.

Sources: [README.md:69-88](), [README.md:322-368](), [.claude-plugin/plugin.json:1-88]()

### Option 2: Manual Installation

Manual installation provides control over which components are installed and allows selective component installation.

**Manual Installation Commands:**

```bash
# Clone repository
git clone https://github.com/affaan-m/everything-claude-code.git
cd everything-claude-code

# Copy agents (11 agent files)
cp agents/*.md ~/.claude/agents/

# Copy rules (6 rule files)
cp rules/*.md ~/.claude/rules/

# Copy commands (20+ command files)
cp commands/*.md ~/.claude/commands/

# Copy skills (directory-based skills)
cp -r skills/* ~/.claude/skills/

# Hooks configuration
# Merge hooks/hooks.json content into ~/.claude/settings.json hooks field
```

**File Inventory After Manual Installation:**

| Component Type | Location | Files Installed | Example Files |
|----------------|----------|-----------------|---------------|
| Agents | `~/.claude/agents/` | 11 files | `planner.md`, `tdd-guide.md`, `code-reviewer.md`, `architect.md`, `security-reviewer.md`, `build-error-resolver.md`, `e2e-runner.md`, `refactor-cleaner.md`, `doc-updater.md`, `go-reviewer.md`, `go-build-resolver.md` |
| Commands | `~/.claude/commands/` | 20+ files | `tdd.md`, `plan.md`, `checkpoint.md`, `verify.md`, `setup-pm.md`, `go-review.md`, `go-test.md`, `go-build.md`, `skill-create.md`, `instinct-status.md`, `evolve.md` |
| Skills | `~/.claude/skills/` | 10+ directories | `coding-standards/`, `backend-patterns/`, `frontend-patterns/`, `tdd-workflow/`, `security-review/`, `eval-harness/`, `verification-loop/`, `golang-patterns/`, `golang-testing/`, `continuous-learning/`, `continuous-learning-v2/` |
| Rules | `~/.claude/rules/` | 6 files | `security.md`, `coding-style.md`, `testing.md`, `git-workflow.md`, `agents.md`, `performance.md` |
| Hooks | `~/.claude/settings.json` | hooks field | PreToolUse, PostToolUse, Stop, SessionStart, SessionEnd, PreCompact |

**MCP Configuration (Optional):**

MCP server configurations are in `mcp-configs/mcp-servers.json`. Copy desired servers to `~/.claude.json` and replace placeholder API keys.

Sources: [README.md:371-401](), [README.md:143-240]()

