## Installation Verification

After installation, verify that plugin components are loaded and operational.

**Verification Process:**

```mermaid
graph TB
    Start["Restart Claude Code"] --> ListPlugins["Execute: /plugin list"]
    ListPlugins --> CheckEnabled{"everything-claude-code@everything-claude-code<br/>shows as enabled?"}
    
    CheckEnabled -->|No| EnablePlugin["Edit ~/.claude/settings.json<br/>Set enabledPlugins entry to true"]
    CheckEnabled -->|Yes| TestSlashCommands["Type / in input field"]
    
    EnablePlugin --> Start
    
    TestSlashCommands --> CheckAutocomplete{"Autocomplete shows:<br/>/tdd /plan /checkpoint<br/>/code-review /verify?"}
    CheckAutocomplete -->|No| CheckCommandFiles["ls ~/.claude/commands/<br/>or check plugin installation"]
    CheckAutocomplete -->|Yes| ExecutePlan["Execute: /plan 'test feature'"]
    
    CheckCommandFiles --> Start
    
    ExecutePlan --> CheckPlannerAgent{"Response includes:<br/>'planner agent'<br/>task breakdown?"}
    CheckPlannerAgent -->|No| CheckAgentFile["Verify ~/.claude/agents/planner.md exists"]
    CheckPlannerAgent -->|Yes| CheckPM["Execute: /setup-pm --detect"]
    
    CheckAgentFile --> Start
    
    CheckPM --> PMDetected{"Output shows detected<br/>package manager?"}
    PMDetected -->|No| ConfigPM["Execute: /setup-pm<br/>to configure"]
    PMDetected -->|Yes| CheckRules["Verify rules installed:<br/>ls ~/.claude/rules/"]
    
    ConfigPM --> CheckRules
    
    CheckRules --> RulesExist{"Files exist:<br/>security.md<br/>coding-style.md<br/>testing.md?"}
    RulesExist -->|No| CopyRules["Copy rules/ directory<br/>from repository"]
    RulesExist -->|Yes| InstallComplete["Installation verified"]
    
    CopyRules --> InstallComplete
```

**Verification Checklist:**

| Component | Verification Method | Expected Output | Troubleshooting |
|-----------|---------------------|-----------------|-----------------|
| Plugin Enabled | `/plugin list` | `everything-claude-code@everything-claude-code` in enabled list | Check `~/.claude/settings.json` `enabledPlugins` field |
| Commands | Type `/` in input | Autocomplete includes `/tdd`, `/plan`, `/checkpoint`, `/verify`, `/code-review`, `/e2e`, `/refactor-clean` | Verify files exist: `ls ~/.claude/commands/*.md` |
| Agents | `/plan 'test'` | Response includes "planner agent" and task breakdown | Verify file exists: `~/.claude/agents/planner.md` |
| Skills | `/tdd` | Response includes TDD workflow steps (RED-GREEN-REFACTOR) | Verify directory exists: `~/.claude/skills/tdd-workflow/` |
| Rules | Check context in response | Claude mentions security checks, testing requirements | Verify files: `ls ~/.claude/rules/*.md` |
| Package Manager | `/setup-pm --detect` | Outputs detected package manager (npm/pnpm/yarn/bun) | Run `/setup-pm` to configure |
| Hooks | Edit TypeScript file | PostToolUse hook fires (prettier, tsc messages) | Check `~/.claude/settings.json` hooks field |

**File-Level Verification Commands:**

```bash
# Verify commands installed
ls -1 ~/.claude/commands/ | grep -E "(tdd|plan|checkpoint|verify)"

# Verify agents installed  
ls -1 ~/.claude/agents/ | grep -E "(planner|tdd-guide|code-reviewer)"

# Verify rules installed
ls -1 ~/.claude/rules/ | grep -E "(security|coding-style|testing)"

# Verify skills installed
ls -1 ~/.claude/skills/ | grep -E "(tdd-workflow|backend-patterns)"

# Check plugin enabled in settings
grep -A 5 "enabledPlugins" ~/.claude/settings.json
```

