## Interface Basics

Claude Code provides several interaction methods. Understanding these is essential for effective plugin use.

### Slash Commands

Slash commands load markdown files from `~/.claude/commands/` and execute their contents. Commands typically invoke agents or provide structured prompts.

**Command Execution Flow:**

```mermaid
graph TB
    UserInput["/tdd feature name"] --> ClaudeCodeParser["Claude Code parses command"]
    ClaudeCodeParser --> LoadFile["Load commands/tdd.md"]
    LoadFile --> ParseFrontmatter["Parse frontmatter:<br/>name: tdd<br/>description: TDD workflow"]
    ParseFrontmatter --> ExecuteBody["Execute markdown body:<br/>Load tdd-guide agent<br/>Load tdd-workflow skill"]
    ExecuteBody --> AgentInvoke["Invoke agents/tdd-guide.md"]
    AgentInvoke --> SkillLoad["Load skills/tdd-workflow/SKILL.md"]
    SkillLoad --> AgentExecution["Agent executes:<br/>tools: Edit, Bash, Grep<br/>model: sonnet"]
    AgentExecution --> OutputResponse["Output: TDD workflow steps"]
```

**Initial Commands Table:**

| Command | File Path | Invoked Agent(s) | Loaded Skills | Description |
|---------|-----------|------------------|---------------|-------------|
| `/plan` | `commands/plan.md` | `agents/planner.md` | `skills/backend-patterns/` | Feature planning and task breakdown. Uses Read, Grep, Glob tools. |
| `/tdd` | `commands/tdd.md` | `agents/tdd-guide.md` | `skills/tdd-workflow/`, `skills/golang-testing/` | Test-driven development workflow. Uses Edit, Bash, Grep tools. |
| `/e2e` | `commands/e2e.md` | `agents/e2e-runner.md` | `skills/backend-patterns/` | End-to-end test generation using Playwright. |
| `/code-review` | `commands/code-review.md` | `agents/code-reviewer.md` | `skills/coding-standards/`, `skills/security-review/` | Quality and security review. Read-only tools. |
| `/checkpoint create` | `commands/checkpoint.md` | None (built-in) | None | Save workflow state (git SHA, test results, coverage). |
| `/verify` | `commands/verify.md` | `agents/build-error-resolver.md` | `skills/verification-loop/` | Run build, type check, lint, test, audit. |
| `/setup-pm` | `commands/setup-pm.md` | None | None | Configure package manager via `scripts/setup-package-manager.js`. |

Sources: [commands/tdd.md:1-45](), [commands/plan.md:1-38](), [commands/checkpoint.md:1-75](), [commands/verify.md:1-60]()

