## Component Relationships

Commands, agents, and skills form a three-tier architecture. Commands invoke agents. Agents load skills and execute tools. Skills provide domain knowledge.

**Command→Agent→Skill Data Flow:**

```mermaid
graph TB
    subgraph UserInterface["User Interface Layer"]
        UserInput["User types: /tdd 'feature'"]
    end
    
    subgraph CommandLayer["Command Layer (commands/)"]
        TddMd["commands/tdd.md:<br/>name: tdd<br/>description: TDD workflow<br/>body: invoke tdd-guide agent"]
        PlanMd["commands/plan.md:<br/>name: plan<br/>description: feature planning<br/>body: invoke planner agent"]
        ReviewMd["commands/code-review.md:<br/>name: code-review<br/>description: quality review<br/>body: invoke code-reviewer agent"]
        VerifyMd["commands/verify.md:<br/>name: verify<br/>description: verification loop<br/>body: run build, test, lint"]
    end
    
    subgraph AgentLayer["Agent Layer (agents/)"]
        TddGuideMd["agents/tdd-guide.md:<br/>tools: Edit, Bash, Grep<br/>model: sonnet<br/>skills: tdd-workflow, golang-testing"]
        PlannerMd["agents/planner.md:<br/>tools: Read, Grep, Glob<br/>model: sonnet<br/>skills: backend-patterns"]
        ReviewerMd["agents/code-reviewer.md:<br/>tools: Read, Grep<br/>model: opus<br/>skills: coding-standards, security-review"]
        BuildResolverMd["agents/build-error-resolver.md:<br/>tools: Edit, Bash<br/>model: sonnet<br/>skills: backend-patterns"]
    end
    
    subgraph SkillLayer["Skill Layer (skills/)"]
        TddWorkflow["skills/tdd-workflow/SKILL.md:<br/>RED-GREEN-REFACTOR cycle<br/>coverage requirements<br/>test structure"]
        BackendPatterns["skills/backend-patterns/SKILL.md:<br/>API design patterns<br/>database patterns<br/>caching strategies"]
        CodingStandards["skills/coding-standards/SKILL.md:<br/>file organization<br/>naming conventions<br/>immutability rules"]
        GolangTesting["skills/golang-testing/SKILL.md:<br/>table-driven tests<br/>testify/assert usage<br/>benchmark patterns"]
    end
    
    subgraph RuleLayer["Rule Layer (rules/)"]
        TestingMd["rules/testing.md:<br/>80% coverage requirement<br/>TDD mandatory<br/>test structure rules"]
        SecurityMd["rules/security.md:<br/>no hardcoded secrets<br/>input validation<br/>SQL injection prevention"]
    end
    
    UserInput --> TddMd
    UserInput --> PlanMd
    UserInput --> ReviewMd
    UserInput --> VerifyMd
    
    TddMd --> TddGuideMd
    PlanMd --> PlannerMd
    ReviewMd --> ReviewerMd
    VerifyMd --> BuildResolverMd
    
    TddGuideMd --> TddWorkflow
    TddGuideMd --> GolangTesting
    PlannerMd --> BackendPatterns
    ReviewerMd --> CodingStandards
    BuildResolverMd --> BackendPatterns
    
    TddGuideMd -.constrained by.-> TestingMd
    ReviewerMd -.constrained by.-> SecurityMd
```

**Component Responsibilities:**

| Component | File Format | Purpose | Example File |
|-----------|-------------|---------|--------------|
| Commands | Markdown with frontmatter | User-facing entry points. Invoke agents or provide structured prompts. | `commands/tdd.md` invokes `agents/tdd-guide.md` |
| Agents | Markdown with frontmatter | Specialized AI subagents with tool permissions and model selection. Execute tasks. | `agents/tdd-guide.md` has Edit, Bash, Grep tools |
| Skills | Markdown in directories | Reusable knowledge bases. Provide domain-specific guidance to agents. | `skills/tdd-workflow/SKILL.md` defines RED-GREEN-REFACTOR |
| Rules | Markdown files | Always-follow constraints. Enforced across all sessions. | `rules/testing.md` requires 80% coverage |

**Tool Permission Boundaries:**

| Agent | File | Tools Allowed | Tools Blocked | Rationale |
|-------|------|---------------|---------------|-----------|
| planner | `agents/planner.md` | Read, Grep, Glob | Edit, Write, Bash | Planning phase should not modify code |
| tdd-guide | `agents/tdd-guide.md` | Edit, Bash, Grep | Write | TDD modifies existing files, runs tests |
| code-reviewer | `agents/code-reviewer.md` | Read, Grep | Edit, Write, Bash | Review should be read-only |
| architect | `agents/architect.md` | Read, Bash | Edit, Write | Architecture analysis, no code changes |
| security-reviewer | `agents/security-reviewer.md` | Read, Bash | Edit, Write | Security scans, no modifications |

See page 3.2 for agent details, page 3.3 for skills, page 3.4 for commands.

Sources: [commands/tdd.md:1-45](), [agents/tdd-guide.md:1-60](), [agents/planner.md:1-55](), [agents/code-reviewer.md:1-70](), [skills/tdd-workflow/SKILL.md:1-80](), [rules/testing.md:1-40]()

