## Command to Agent to Skill Relationship

### Delegation Hierarchy

```mermaid
graph TB
    subgraph "User Interface"
        UserCmd["/plan 'Add OAuth'"]
        UserTdd["/tdd"]
        UserReview["/code-review"]
    end

    subgraph "Command Layer (commands/)"
        PlanCmd["plan.md<br/>Quick prompt"]
        TddCmd["tdd.md<br/>Delegates to agent"]
