This page provides comprehensive installation instructions for the Everything Claude Code plugin, covering both automated plugin marketplace installation and manual installation methods. It includes package manager configuration, directory structure initialization, and verification steps to ensure a successful setup.

For information about configuring individual components after installation, see [Configuration Guide](#10). For troubleshooting installation issues, see [Plugin Installation Issues](#14.4).

