## Rules Installation

Rules are always-follow guidelines that apply across all projects. The Claude Code plugin system does not support distributing rules via plugins, requiring separate installation.

For comprehensive rules installation instructions including user-level vs project-level installation, language-specific rule selection, and the `install.sh` script usage, see **[Rules Installation](#4.4)**.

**Quick reference:**

```bash
# User-level (applies to all projects)
cp -r everything-claude-code/rules/common/* ~/.claude/rules/
cp -r everything-claude-code/rules/typescript/* ~/.claude/rules/

# Or use install.sh
./install.sh typescript python golang
```

