| `~/.claude/homunculus/` | Continuous learning v2 | PreToolUse/PostToolUse hooks | Auto |
| `~/.claude/settings.json` | Global configuration | User | Yes |
| `~/.claude.json` | MCP server configuration | User | Optional |

### Project-Level Directories (.claude/)

