|-----------|---------|------------|----------|
| `.claude/rules/` | Project-specific rules | User | Optional |
| `.claude/config.json` | Project configuration | User | Optional |
| `.claude/checkpoints.log` | Verification state | `/checkpoint` command | Auto |
| `.claude/package-manager.json` | Package manager config | `/setup-pm` command | Auto |
| `.claude/contexts/` | Dynamic system prompts | User | Optional |

### Plugin Directories (~/.claude/plugins/everything-claude-code@everything-claude-code/)

| Directory | Purpose | Contents |
|-----------|---------|----------|
| `.claude-plugin/` | Plugin metadata | `plugin.json`, `marketplace.json` |
| `agents/` | Agent definitions | 15+ agent markdown files |
| `skills/` | Skill definitions | 30+ skill directories |
| `commands/` | Command definitions | 40+ command markdown files |
| `hooks/` | Hook configurations | `hooks.json`, hook scripts |
| `scripts/` | Node.js utilities | Cross-platform automation scripts |
| `tests/` | Test suite | Library and hook tests |

### Auto-Created Files

The following files are created automatically during normal operation:

```bash
