```

### Common Issues

| Issue | Symptom | Solution |
|-------|---------|----------|
| Rules not loaded | Security warnings not appearing | Copy rules to `~/.claude/rules/` |
| Hooks not firing | No post-processing on file edits | Check Claude Code version (v2.1.0+ required) |
| Package manager errors | npm used instead of pnpm | Run `/setup-pm pnpm` |
| Context window small | 70k instead of 200k | Disable unused MCPs (see [Context Window Management](#10.3)) |
| Commands not found | `/plan` command unavailable | Reinstall plugin or check `enabledPlugins` |

Sources: [README.md:64-100](), [README.md:463-474]()

