## Platform Limitations

The plugin system has specific constraints:

| Component | Distribution Method | Why |
|-----------|-------------------|-----|
| Agents | Plugin (automatic) | Supported by plugin system |
| Skills | Plugin (automatic) | Supported by plugin system |
| Commands | Plugin (automatic) | Supported by plugin system |
| Hooks | Plugin (auto-loaded) | Convention-based loading |
| Rules | **Manual only** | Platform limitation (upstream) |
| MCP configs | Manual only | API keys required, not safe to distribute |

The rules limitation is documented at [code.claude.com/docs/en/plugins-reference](https://code.claude.com/docs/en/plugins-reference). This is why [Rules Installation](#4.4) is a required separate step.

**Sources:** [README.md:527-544](), [README.md:136-152]()

---

## Troubleshooting

### "Duplicate hooks file detected"

**Symptom:** Error message when starting Claude Code.

**Cause:** A `"hooks"` field was added to [.claude-plugin/plugin.json]().

**Fix:** Remove the `"hooks"` field. Hooks auto-load by convention in Claude Code v2.1.0+.

**Sources:** [README.md:711-713](), [README.md:468-490]()

---

### Commands not found

**Symptom:** `/plan` not found, but `/everything-claude-code:plan` works.

**Cause:** Plugin install uses namespaced commands.

**Fix:** Use the full namespace or switch to manual installation for shorter command names.

**Sources:** [README.md:158-165]()

---

### Rules not active

**Symptom:** Claude doesn't follow coding standards/testing rules.

**Cause:** Rules are not distributed via plugin.

**Fix:** Install rules manually. See [Rules Installation](#4.4).

**Sources:** [README.md:136-152](), [README.md:527-544]()

---

### Context window degradation

**Symptom:** Context window shrinks from 200k to ~70k after plugin install.

**Cause:** Too many MCP servers enabled (each MCP adds tool descriptions that consume tokens).

**Fix:** See [Context Window Management](#9.3) for MCP discipline (20-30 configured, 5-10 enabled).

**Sources:** [README.md:716-729]()

---

