## Method 2: Semi-Automated with install.sh

The [install.sh]() script provides language-targeted installation with merge/overwrite detection.

### Basic Usage

```bash
# Navigate to cloned repository
cd everything-claude-code

# Install for specific language(s)
./install.sh typescript
./install.sh python golang
./install.sh typescript python golang  # multiple languages

# Target specific platforms
./install.sh --target cursor typescript
./install.sh --target opencode python
./install.sh --target codex golang
```

The script installs:
- Common rules ([rules/common]())
- Language-specific rules ([rules/typescript](), [rules/python](), [rules/golang]())
- Core skills (if `--target` specifies Claude Code)
- Platform-specific configurations (if `--target` specified)

**Sources:** [README.md:145-150](), [package.json:80]()

### install.sh Execution Flow

```mermaid
graph TB
    Start["./install.sh typescript"]
    
    ParseArgs["Parse arguments<br/>--target, --user, languages"]
    DetectPlatform["Detect platform<br/>(claude-code default)"]
    
    CheckExisting["Check existing<br/>~/.claude/rules/"]
    Prompt{{"Existing rules found?<br/>Merge or overwrite?"}}
    
    CopyCommon["Copy rules/common/*<br/>to ~/.claude/rules/"]
    CopyLang["Copy rules/typescript/*<br/>to ~/.claude/rules/"]
    
    CopySkills{{"Target = claude-code?"}}
    CopySkillsYes["Copy core skills<br/>to ~/.claude/skills/"]
    
    PlatformConfig{{"Target platform-specific?"}}
    CopyCursor["Copy .cursor/ configs"]
    CopyOpenCode["Copy .opencode/ configs"]
    CopyCodex["Copy .codex/ configs"]
    
    Verify["Verify installation<br/>ls -la ~/.claude/"]
    
    Start --> ParseArgs
    ParseArgs --> DetectPlatform
    DetectPlatform --> CheckExisting
    CheckExisting --> Prompt
    Prompt -->|"User chooses"| CopyCommon
    CopyCommon --> CopyLang
    CopyLang --> CopySkills
    CopySkills -->|Yes| CopySkillsYes
    CopySkills -->|No| PlatformConfig
    CopySkillsYes --> PlatformConfig
    PlatformConfig -->|cursor| CopyCursor
    PlatformConfig -->|opencode| CopyOpenCode
    PlatformConfig -->|codex| CopyCodex
    PlatformConfig -->|none| Verify
    CopyCursor --> Verify
    CopyOpenCode --> Verify
    CopyCodex --> Verify
```

**Sources:** [README.md:145-150](), [the-longform-guide.md:1-354]()

### install.sh Options

| Flag | Purpose | Example |
|------|---------|---------|
| `--target <platform>` | Target platform (cursor, opencode, codex) | `./install.sh --target cursor typescript` |
| `--user` | Install to `~/.claude/` (default) | `./install.sh --user typescript` |
| `--project` | Install to `.claude/` (project-level) | `./install.sh --project python` |
| Languages | Space-separated language list | `./install.sh typescript python golang` |

**Sources:** [README.md:145-150]()

