## Comparison: Manual vs Plugin Installation

| Aspect | Manual Installation | Plugin Installation |
|--------|---------------------|---------------------|
| Component Control | Full — select exactly what to install | Limited — installs all agents, commands, skills |
| Hooks | Manual merge into `settings.json` | Automatically loaded from [hooks/hooks.json]() |
| Rules | Manual copy (required step) | Manual copy (platform limitation) |
| Updates | Manual `git pull` + re-copy | Automatic via `/plugin update` |
| Configuration | Manual editing | Plugin marketplace handles it |
| Debugging | Full filesystem access | Limited to plugin sandbox |
| Cross-platform | Requires platform-specific steps | Plugin marketplace abstracts platform |
| Installation Time | 10-20 minutes (first time) | 2-5 minutes |
| Recommended For | Power users, custom setups | Most users |

**Sources:** [README.md:495-589](), [the-shortform-guide.md:158-183]()

