    CoreNiche --> CoreSet
    CoreNiche --> CategorySelect["Proceed to<br/>category selection"]
    
    Niche --> CategorySelect
```

The core bundle includes [skills/configure-ecc/SKILL.md:66-79]():
- `.agents/skills/*` - All agent-embedded skills
- `skills/search-first/` - Research-before-coding workflow (see [Search-First Workflow](#10.2))
- TDD, E2E, evals, verification workflows
- Security review, strategic compaction
- Frontend patterns and cross-functional Anthropic skills

