## Language-Specific Agents

### Go Agents

| Agent | File | Model | Tools | Purpose |
|-------|------|-------|-------|---------|
| **go-reviewer** | `agents/go-reviewer.md` | Sonnet | Read, Grep, Glob | Go idioms, concurrency patterns, error handling |
| **go-build-resolver** | `agents/go-build-resolver.md` | Sonnet | Read, Write, Edit, Bash | Go compilation errors, module issues |

**go-reviewer** — Go-specific code review. Checks for proper error handling, goroutine leaks, channel deadlocks, idiomatic Go patterns. Uses `staticcheck` and `golangci-lint` via Bash. Invoked via `/go-review` command.

**go-build-resolver** — Fixes Go build errors. Handles module version conflicts, import cycle detection, cgo issues. Invoked via `/go-build` command.

