## Configuration Files and Storage

### Agent File Locations

```
~/.claude/agents/          # User-level agents (apply to all projects)
.claude/agents/            # Project-level agents (apply to current project)
.claude-plugin/agents/     # Plugin-distributed agents (via plugin system)
```

**Priority:** Project-level > User-level > Plugin-distributed

### Agent Discovery

Claude Code scans these directories at startup and builds an agent registry. Agents are invoked by their `name` field from YAML frontmatter.

**Collision Handling:** If two agents have the same `name`, the highest priority location wins.

