## Agent Creation Guidelines

For detailed instructions on creating custom agents, see [Contributing Agents](#14.1).

**Quick checklist:**

1. Create `agents/my-agent.md` with YAML frontmatter
2. Specify `name`, `description`, `tools`, optional `model`
3. Write focused system prompt (one clear task, not multiple responsibilities)
4. Grant minimum necessary tool permissions
5. Choose appropriate model (Haiku for simple, Sonnet for most, Opus for complex)
6. Test with `/my-agent` or explicit delegation
7. Add validation test in `tests/validate-agents.js`

