This page provides a complete reference for all slash commands available in Everything Claude Code. Commands are executable prompts that trigger specific workflows, agents, or skills. They provide quick access to common development tasks without requiring full prompt composition.

For detailed information about the agents invoked by these commands, see [Agent Reference](#5.1). For the underlying skills and workflows, see [Skills Reference](#5.2).

