ECC provides 30+ commands organized into the following categories:

| Category | Command Count | Purpose |
|----------|--------------|---------|
| [Planning & Architecture](#planning--architecture) | 5 | Feature planning, system design, task decomposition |
| [Development Workflows](#development-workflows) | 6 | TDD, implementation, refactoring |
| [Testing & Quality](#testing--quality) | 4 | Test generation, coverage analysis, E2E testing |
| [Code Review & Security](#code-review--security) | 5 | Quality review, security scanning, language-specific review |
| [Continuous Learning](#continuous-learning) | 6 | Pattern extraction, instinct management, skill generation |
| [Multi-Agent Orchestration](#multi-agent-orchestration) | 6 | Parallel execution, service coordination, PM2 management |
| [Session & Context Management](#session--context-management) | 5 | Session history, context persistence, compaction |
| [Project Setup & Configuration](#project-setup--configuration) | 2 | Package manager setup, project initialization |
| [Specialized Workflows](#specialized-workflows) | 3 | Documentation updates, codebase mapping, build fixes |

