### Tool Restrictions

Restrict tools for read-only or write-only passes:

```bash
# Read-only analysis
claude -p --allowedTools "Read,Grep,Glob" "/code-review src/"

# Write-only implementation
claude -p --allowedTools "Read,Write,Edit,Bash" "/tdd"
```

**Sources:** [skills/autonomous-loops/SKILL.md:96-100]()

