## Rules vs Skills vs Commands

Understanding when to use each component:

| Component | Activation | Scope | Example |
|-----------|-----------|-------|---------|
| **Rules** | Automatic, every session | Always active | "Always use conventional commits" |
| **Skills** | Invoked by agents/commands | Workflow-specific | TDD methodology, security checklist |
| **Commands** | User explicitly calls | Single execution | `/tdd`, `/code-review`, `/verify` |

