## Rules Verification

### Automated Validation

The CI pipeline validates rule integrity:

```bash
# Validate rules exist and are non-empty
node tests/validate-rules.js

# Check cross-references
grep -rn "See \[.*\](.*)" rules/

# Verify language-specific rules extend common
grep -rn "extends.*common" rules/typescript/ rules/python/ rules/golang/
```

### Manual Verification

After installation, verify rules are loaded:

```bash
# Check user-level rules
ls -la ~/.claude/rules/

# Check project-level rules
ls -la .claude/rules/

# Verify rule count
find ~/.claude/rules/ -name "*.md" | wc -l
# Expected: 8 (common) + 5 per language
```

