## Platform Variables

Hooks can use environment variables for path resolution:

| Variable | Value | Usage |
|----------|-------|-------|
| `CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT` | `/path/to/.claude-plugin` | Resolve hook scripts in plugin installations |
| `CLAUDE_SESSION_ID` | `abc123...` | Track per-session state (e.g., tool call counter) |
| `CLAUDE_TRANSCRIPT_PATH` | `/path/to/transcript.jsonl` | Legacy fallback for transcript access |
| `TMUX` | Set when inside tmux | Detect tmux environment for dev server hooks |

**Example from hooks.json:**

```json
{
  "command": "${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/scripts/hooks/session-start.js"
}
```

Expands to: `~/.claude-plugin/scripts/hooks/session-start.js`

