## Hook 5: observe.sh (Continuous Learning)

**Purpose:** Capture tool use events (input + output) for continuous learning pattern detection. Runs **asynchronously** in background.

**Matcher:** `*` (all tools)

**Registration:**
```json
{
  "matcher": "*",
  "hooks": [{
    "type": "command",
    "command": "${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/skills/continuous-learning-v2/hooks/observe.sh",
    "async": true,
    "timeout": 10
  }],
  "description": "Capture tool use results for continuous learning"
}
```

### Asynchronous Execution

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant Tool as "Edit Tool Completes"
    participant Sync as "Sync Hooks<br/>(format, typecheck)"
    participant Async as "observe.sh (async)"
    participant Agent as "Main Agent"
    participant Observer as "Observer Daemon"

    Tool->>Sync: "tool_input + tool_output"
    Tool->>Async: "tool_input + tool_output"
    Note over Async: "async: true<br/>timeout: 10s"
    
    Sync->>Sync: "Format file"
    Sync->>Sync: "Run tsc"
    Sync->>Agent: "All sync hooks done"
    Note over Agent: "Response sent to user"
    
    par Async execution continues
        Async->>Async: "Detect project (git remote)"
        Async->>Async: "Append to observations.jsonl"
        Async->>Async: "kill -USR1 observer PID"
    end
    
    Observer->>Observer: "Receives USR1 signal"
    Observer->>Observer: "Analyze observations.jsonl"
    Observer->>Observer: "Generate instincts"
```

**Key characteristics:**

| Property | Value | Impact |
|----------|-------|--------|
| `async: true` | Background execution | No response latency |
| `timeout: 10` | 10 second limit | Prevents hanging |
| Matcher `*` | All tools | Complete observation coverage |
| Signal USR1 | Triggers observer | Real-time pattern detection |

### Observation Format

Written to project-scoped `observations.jsonl`:

```jsonl
{"timestamp":"2025-01-22T10:30:00Z","event":"tool_start","session":"abc123","tool":"Edit","input":{"file_path":"src/auth.ts"},"project_id":"a1b2c3d4e5f6"}
{"timestamp":"2025-01-22T10:30:01Z","event":"tool_complete","session":"abc123","tool":"Edit","output":{"status":"success"},"project_id":"a1b2c3d4e5f6"}
```

**Storage location:**
- Project-scoped: `~/.claude/homunculus/projects/<project-hash>/observations.jsonl`
- Global fallback: `~/.claude/homunculus/observations.jsonl`

See [Continuous Learning System](#8) for complete architecture.

