### Session Evaluation Logic

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    Start["SessionEnd Event"]
    ReadTranscript["Read CLAUDE_TRANSCRIPT_PATH"]
    CheckExists{"Transcript<br/>exists?"}
    CountMessages["Count user messages"]
    CheckLength{"Messages >= 10?"}
    SkipShort["Skip: Session too short"]
