### Session Evaluation Thresholds

| Metric | Threshold | Behavior |
|--------|-----------|----------|
| Minimum user messages | 10 | Skip evaluation if below threshold |
| Transcript format | JSONL | One JSON object per line |
| Output file | `observations.jsonl` | Append-only log for Observer Agent |

The evaluation script reads from `CLAUDE_TRANSCRIPT_PATH` environment variable and only processes sessions with at least 10 user messages to ensure meaningful pattern extraction.

