## Test Execution Flow

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant CI as CI / Developer
    participant Runner as runTests()
    participant Helper as asyncTest()
    participant Simulator as runHookWithInput()
    participant Hook as Hook Script
    
    CI->>Runner: node tests/integration/hooks.test.js
    Runner->>Runner: Initialize counters (passed/failed)
    Runner->>Runner: Load hooks.json
    
    loop For each test category
        Runner->>Helper: asyncTest(name, fn)
        Helper->>Simulator: runHookWithInput(script, input, env)
        Simulator->>Hook: spawn node + write JSON to stdin
        Hook->>Simulator: stdout/stderr/exit code
        Simulator->>Helper: {code, stdout, stderr}
        Helper->>Helper: assert expectations
        Helper->>Runner: true/false (pass/fail)
        Runner->>Runner: Update counters
    end
    
    Runner->>CI: exit(failed > 0 ? 1 : 0)
```

