```

**Null Content Handling:** The hook handles null elements in `content[]` arrays (regression fix for transcript format changes) [scripts/hooks/session-end.js:88-95](), [tests/hooks/hooks.test.js:550-568]().

**Sources:** [scripts/hooks/session-end.js:1-230](), [tests/hooks/hooks.test.js:229-273]()

### PreCompact Hook: Compaction Logging

The `pre-compact.js` hook annotates session files and logs compaction events:

**Compaction Marker Format:**
```markdown
<!-- Compaction occurred at YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM:SS -->
```

**Compaction Log Format:**
```
[YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM:SS] Compaction occurred (active session: filename)
```

The log is appended to `~/.claude/sessions/compaction-log.txt` [scripts/hooks/pre-compact.js:60-80]().

**Sources:** [scripts/hooks/pre-compact.js:1-130](), [tests/hooks/hooks.test.js:275-338]()

