## Purpose and Scope

The Session Manager API provides core CRUD operations for Claude Code sessions stored in `~/.claude/sessions/`. This library handles session file parsing, metadata extraction, content reading/writing, and session listing with pagination and filtering.

For information about:
- Session lifecycle hooks (SessionStart, SessionEnd) that use this API, see [Session Lifecycle & Persistence](#7.4)
- Human-readable aliases for sessions, see [Session Aliases System](#7.3)
- Session file naming conventions and format specification, see [Session Files & Format](#7.1)

**Sources:** [scripts/lib/session-manager.js:1-10]()

