## Data Flow: Session Retrieval with Content

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant Caller
    participant getSessionById
    participant fs["fs (Node.js)"]
    participant parseSessionFilename
    participant getSessionContent
    participant parseSessionMetadata
    participant getSessionStats
    
    Caller->>getSessionById: getSessionById('abcd1234', true)
    getSessionById->>fs: readdirSync(sessionsDir)
    fs-->>getSessionById: [entry1, entry2, ...]
    
    loop For each entry
        getSessionById->>parseSessionFilename: parseSessionFilename(filename)
        parseSessionFilename-->>getSessionById: {shortId, date, ...}
        
