## Error Handling and Edge Cases

### Filename Parsing

| Input | Behavior | Reason |
|-------|----------|--------|
| `'2026-13-01-abc12345-session.tmp'` | Returns `null` | Month 13 invalid |
| `'2026-02-31-abc12345-session.tmp'` | Returns `null` | Feb 31 doesn't exist |
| `'2025-02-29-abc12345-session.tmp'` | Returns `null` | 2025 not leap year |
| `'2024-02-29-abc12345-session.tmp'` | Valid | 2024 is leap year |
| `'2026-06-31-abc12345-session.tmp'` | Returns `null` | June has 30 days |
| `'2026-06-30-abc12345-session.tmp'` | Valid | Valid 30-day month |
| `'2026-02-01-ABCD1234-session.tmp'` | Returns `null` | Uppercase rejected |
| `'2026-02-01-abc-session.tmp'` | Returns `null` | Short ID < 8 chars |

**Sources:** [tests/lib/session-manager.test.js:72-654]()

---

### Pagination Edge Cases

| Input | Behavior | Output |
|-------|----------|--------|
| `offset: -5` | Clamped to 0 | `{ offset: 0, ... }` |
| `offset: NaN` | Clamped to 0 | `{ offset: 0, ... }` |
| `offset: Infinity` | Clamped to 0 (slice returns empty) | `{ sessions: [], ... }` |
| `limit: -10` | Clamped to 1 | `{ limit: 1, ... }` |
| `limit: 0` | Clamped to 1 | `{ limit: 1, ... }` |
| `limit: NaN` | Clamped to 50 (default) | `{ limit: 50, ... }` |
| `offset: 1.7` | Floored to 1 | `{ offset: 1, ... }` |
| `offset: 999` (beyond total) | Valid (empty result) | `{ sessions: [], hasMore: false }` |

**Sources:** [tests/lib/session-manager.test.js:760-817]()

---

### TOCTOU Race Conditions

**Time-of-Check-Time-of-Use (TOCTOU) handling:**

1. **`getAllSessions()`**: Wraps `statSync()` in try-catch to handle files deleted between `readdirSync()` and `statSync()` [scripts/lib/session-manager.js:241-246]()

2. **`getSessionById()`**: Wraps `statSync()` in try-catch and returns `null` if file deleted [scripts/lib/session-manager.js:307-311]()

**Rationale:** Session files may be deleted by concurrent processes (e.g., cleanup commands) while iterating directory entries. Catching ENOENT prevents crashes.

**Sources:** [scripts/lib/session-manager.js:241-246](), [scripts/lib/session-manager.js:307-311]()

---

