## Error Handling

### Common Error Scenarios

```mermaid
graph TB
    CorruptJSON["Corrupted alias file<br/>(invalid JSON)"]
    MissingField["Missing aliases field<br/>in loaded data"]
    InvalidCallback["Non-function sessionExists<br/>in cleanupAliases"]
