## Backward Compatibility

The v2.1 system maintains compatibility with prior versions:

| Component | v1 | v2.0 | v2.1 |
|-----------|----|----|------|
| **Observation** | Stop hook only | PreToolUse + PostToolUse | + Project scoping |
| **Storage** | `skills/learned/` | `homunculus/instincts/` | `homunculus/projects/{hash}/` |
| **Instinct format** | N/A | YAML + markdown | + `scope`, `project_id` |
| **v1 skills** | Active | Active (still loaded) | Active (still loaded) |
| **Global instincts** | N/A | Active | Active (unchanged) |

**Migration path:**

1. v1 Stop hook continues to run (feeds into both v1 and v2 systems)
2. Existing `~/.claude/skills/learned/` skills continue to work
3. Existing `~/.claude/homunculus/instincts/personal/` instincts become global instincts automatically (v2.1 defaults missing `scope` field to `global`)
4. New observations automatically get project scoping without user action

**Sources:** [skills/continuous-learning-v2/SKILL.md:341-346]()

