### Storage Paths

| Scope | Source | Path |
|-------|--------|------|
| Global | Auto-learned | `~/.claude/homunculus/instincts/personal/*.md` |
| Global | Imported | `~/.claude/homunculus/instincts/inherited/*.md` |
| Project | Auto-learned | `~/.claude/homunculus/projects/<hash>/instincts/personal/*.md` |
| Project | Imported | `~/.claude/homunculus/projects/<hash>/instincts/inherited/*.md` |

The project hash is a 12-character identifier derived from the git remote URL, ensuring the same repository on different machines shares the same project ID.

