This page documents the configuration system for Everything Claude Code (ECC), including directory structure, settings files, package manager detection, MCP configuration, and project-specific overrides. For installation procedures, see [Installation & Setup](#4). For hooks configuration details, see [Hooks System](#6).

---

## Directory Structure

ECC uses a multi-layered directory hierarchy with user-level (`~/.claude/`) and project-level (`.claude/`) configurations.

### Directory Hierarchy Diagram

```mermaid
graph TB
    subgraph "User-Level: ~/.claude/"
        UserConfig["settings.json"]
        UserMCP["~/.claude.json<br/>(MCP servers)"]
        UserSessions["sessions/<br/>(session files)"]
        UserSkills["skills/<br/>(workflow definitions)"]
        UserAgents["agents/<br/>(subagent definitions)"]
        UserCommands["commands/<br/>(slash commands)"]
        UserRules["rules/<br/>(always-follow guidelines)"]
        UserLearned["skills/learned/<br/>(generated skills)"]
        UserInstincts["homunculus/<br/>(learned patterns)"]
        UserAliases["session-aliases.json"]
        UserPM["package-manager.json<br/>(global PM preference)"]
    end
    
    subgraph "Project-Level: .claude/"
        ProjSettings[".claude/settings.json<br/>(project overrides)"]
        ProjPM[".claude/package-manager.json<br/>(project PM)"]
        ProjRules[".claude/rules/<br/>(project-specific rules)"]
    end
    
    subgraph "Plugin System"
        PluginManifest[".claude-plugin/plugin.json"]
        PluginMarketplace[".claude-plugin/marketplace.json"]
    end
    
    UserConfig -->|merged with| ProjSettings
    UserPM -->|overridden by| ProjPM
    UserRules -->|augmented by| ProjRules
    PluginManifest -->|references| UserSkills
    PluginManifest -->|references| UserAgents
    PluginManifest -->|references| UserCommands
```

**Sources:** [scripts/lib/utils.js:49-71](), [scripts/lib/session-manager.js:12-31](), [scripts/lib/session-aliases.js:11-25]()

### Directory Contents Reference

| Directory | Purpose | Scope | Example Files |
|-----------|---------|-------|--------------|
| `~/.claude/settings.json` | Claude Code settings, hooks, disabled MCPs, enabled plugins | User | hooks config, disabledMcpServers |
| `~/.claude.json` | MCP server definitions | User | GitHub, Supabase, Vercel MCPs |
| `~/.claude/sessions/` | Session persistence files (`.tmp` format) | User | `2026-02-01-a1b2c3d4-session.tmp` |
| `~/.claude/skills/` | Workflow definitions (markdown) | User | `tdd-workflow/SKILL.md` |
| `~/.claude/skills/learned/` | Auto-generated skills from continuous learning | User | `testing-patterns.md` |
| `~/.claude/agents/` | Subagent definitions (markdown with YAML frontmatter) | User | `planner.md`, `code-reviewer.md` |
| `~/.claude/commands/` | Slash commands (markdown) | User | `tdd.md`, `plan.md` |
| `~/.claude/rules/` | Always-follow guidelines | User | `security.md`, `coding-style.md` |
| `~/.claude/homunculus/` | Continuous learning v2 storage | User | `instincts/`, `observations.jsonl` |
| `~/.claude/session-aliases.json` | Session alias mappings | User | `{"my-project": {...}}` |
| `~/.claude/package-manager.json` | Global package manager preference | User | `{"packageManager": "pnpm"}` |
| `.claude/settings.json` | Project-specific settings overrides | Project | Project-scoped MCP disabling |
| `.claude/package-manager.json` | Project package manager override | Project | `{"packageManager": "bun"}` |
| `.claude/rules/` | Project-specific rules (augment user rules) | Project | `project-patterns.md` |
| `.claude-plugin/plugin.json` | Plugin manifest (for plugin authors) | Project | Component paths, metadata |
| `.claude-plugin/marketplace.json` | Marketplace catalog entry | Project | Plugin listing |

**Sources:** [README.md:206-378](), [tests/lib/utils.test.js:49-71](), [tests/lib/session-manager.test.js:28-41]()

