## Context Window Impact

The number of enabled plugins directly impacts available context window. See [Context Window Management](#10.3) for detailed optimization strategies.

**Rule of thumb:**
- Configure 20-30 plugins total
- Enable fewer than 10 plugins per project
- Keep active tool count under 80

**Sources:** [README.md:510-519](), [the-shortform-guide.md:138-153]()

