        PACKAGE_MANAGER["project/.claude/package-manager.json<br/>Key: packageManager<br/>Value: npm|pnpm|yarn|bun"]
    end
    
    subgraph "Runtime Resolution (Code Path)"
        LOAD_USER["Load ~/.claude.json mcpServers"]
        LOAD_PROJECT["Load project/.claude.json<br/>projects.'.'.disabledMcpServers"]
        FILTER["Filter: mcpServers - disabledMcpServers"]
        REGISTER["Register filtered MCPs<br/>with Claude Code runtime"]
    end
    
    USER_CLAUDE --> LOAD_USER
    PROJECT_CLAUDE --> LOAD_PROJECT
    PROJECT_CONFIG --> LOAD_PROJECT
    
    LOAD_USER --> FILTER
    LOAD_PROJECT --> FILTER
    FILTER --> REGISTER
```

**Key Configuration Paths:**

| File Path | Key Configuration Fields | Purpose |
|-----------|-------------------------|---------|
| `~/.claude.json` | `mcpServers` (object) | Define all available MCP servers |
| `~/.claude/settings.json` | `extraKnownMarketplaces`, `enabledPlugins`, `disabledMcpServers` | User-level plugin and MCP control |
| `project/.claude.json` | `projects.".".disabledMcpServers` (array) | Project-specific MCP disabling |
| `project/.claude/config.json` | Same as `.claude.json` | Alternative project config location |
| `project/.claude/package-manager.json` | `packageManager` (string) | Package manager override |

**Sources:** [README.md:336-351](), [README.md:510-520](), [scripts/lib/package-manager.js]()

