### Model Selection by Phase

Different workflow phases use different models for cost/quality tradeoffs:

| Phase | Typical Model | Rationale | Example Agent |
|-------|---------------|-----------|---------------|
| Exploration | Haiku | Fast file search, low reasoning | researcher |
