| Implementation | Sonnet | Best balance for coding | tdd-guide |
| Simple edits | Haiku | Single-file changes | — |
| Review | Opus | Cannot miss critical issues | code-reviewer, security-reviewer |
| Verification | Sonnet | Good at running test suites | build-error-resolver |
| Documentation | Haiku | Structure is straightforward | doc-updater |

