## Quality Gates and Verification

### Verification Checkpoint Architecture

Workflows incorporate quality gates at logical intervals:

```mermaid
graph TB
    subgraph "Workflow Execution"
        Impl["Implementation Phase"]
        Gate1["Quality Gate 1:<br/>PostToolUse Hooks"]
        Gate2["Quality Gate 2:<br/>/checkpoint verify"]
        Gate3["Quality Gate 3:<br/>/verify pipeline"]
        Commit["Commit & Push"]
    end
    
    subgraph "Gate 1: Write-Time Quality"
        Format["Auto-format<br/>(post-edit-format.js)"]
        TypeCheck["Type Check<br/>(post-edit-typecheck.js)"]
        ConsoleWarn["Console.log Warning<br/>(post-edit-console-warn.js)"]
    end
    
    subgraph "Gate 2: Explicit Checkpoints"
        CheckpointCreate["/checkpoint create<br/>'Feature X complete'"]
        CheckpointVerify["/checkpoint verify<br/>Run build + tests"]
        CheckpointList["/checkpoint list<br/>Review history"]
    end
    
    subgraph "Gate 3: Full Verification"
        VerifyBuild["Build"]
        VerifyType["Type Check"]
        VerifyLint["Lint"]
        VerifyTest["Test Suite"]
        VerifyGit["Git Status Clean"]
    end
    
    Impl --> Gate1
    Gate1 --> Format
    Gate1 --> TypeCheck
    Gate1 --> ConsoleWarn
    
    Format --> Gate2
    TypeCheck --> Gate2
    ConsoleWarn --> Gate2
    
    Gate2 --> CheckpointCreate
    CheckpointCreate --> CheckpointVerify
    CheckpointVerify --> CheckpointList
    
    CheckpointList --> Gate3
    Gate3 --> VerifyBuild
    VerifyBuild --> VerifyType
    VerifyType --> VerifyLint
    VerifyLint --> VerifyTest
    VerifyTest --> VerifyGit
    
    VerifyGit --> Commit
```

Quality enforcement operates at three levels:
1. **Write-time (hooks)**: Automated, transparent (40-50% of issues)
2. **User-initiated (checkpoints)**: Explicit save/verify points
3. **Pre-commit (verify)**: Full pipeline before git operations

Sources: [hooks/hooks.json]() (referenced), [commands/checkpoint.md]() (referenced), [commands/verify.md]() (referenced), [skills/plankton-code-quality/SKILL.md:20-56]()

