## Purpose and Scope

This page documents the end-to-end workflow for developing production-ready features using Everything Claude Code. It covers the sequential execution of commands `/plan → /tdd → /code-review → /verify → /checkpoint` and how agents, hooks, and verification systems combine to enforce quality gates at each stage.

For language-specific workflows, see [Test-Driven Development Workflow](#11.2), [Spring Boot Development Workflow](#11.4), and [Go Development Workflow](#11.5). For orchestrating multiple agents in parallel, see [Workflow Orchestration Commands](#7.4). For defining success criteria before implementation, see [Eval-Driven Development Workflow](#11.7).

---

## Workflow Overview

The complete feature development workflow consists of five sequential phases, each enforced by commands and agents with specific responsibilities:

```mermaid
graph TB
    Start["Feature Request"]
    
    subgraph Phase1["Phase 1: Planning"]
        Plan["/plan command"]
        PlannerAgent["planner agent<br/>(Sonnet model)"]
        PlanDoc["plan.md output"]
    end
    
    subgraph Phase2["Phase 2: Implementation"]
        TDD["/tdd command"]
        TDDAgent["tdd-guide agent<br/>(Sonnet model)"]
        Tests["Tests (RED-GREEN-REFACTOR)"]
        Code["Implementation Code"]
    end
    
    subgraph Phase3["Phase 3: Review"]
        Review["/code-review command"]
        ReviewerAgent["code-reviewer agent<br/>(Opus model)"]
        SecurityAgent["security-reviewer agent<br/>(Opus model)"]
        ReviewReport["review-report.md"]
    end
    
    subgraph Phase4["Phase 4: Verification"]
        Verify["/verify command"]
        VerifyChecks["Build + Types + Lint<br/>Tests + Coverage<br/>Security Scan"]
        VerifyReport["Verification Report"]
    end
    
    subgraph Phase5["Phase 5: Checkpointing"]
        Checkpoint["/checkpoint command"]
        CheckpointLog[".claude/checkpoints.log"]
        GitCommit["Git SHA recorded"]
    end
    
    Start --> Plan
    Plan --> PlannerAgent
    PlannerAgent --> PlanDoc
    PlanDoc --> TDD
    
    TDD --> TDDAgent
    TDDAgent --> Tests
    Tests --> Code
    Code --> Review
    
    Review --> ReviewerAgent
    ReviewerAgent --> SecurityAgent
    SecurityAgent --> ReviewReport
    ReviewReport --> Verify
    
    Verify --> VerifyChecks
    VerifyChecks --> VerifyReport
    VerifyReport --> Checkpoint
    
    Checkpoint --> CheckpointLog
    Checkpoint --> GitCommit
    
    VerifyReport -->|FAIL| TDD
    ReviewReport -->|Issues Found| TDD
```

**Sources:** [README.md:176-196](), [the-longform-guide.md:269-286]()

