    TDD_AGENT -->|"2. Write tests"| TEST["Table-driven<br/>tests"]
    TDD_AGENT -->|"3. Implement"| IMPL["Minimal code<br/>to pass"]
    TDD_AGENT -->|"4. Verify"| COV["go test -cover<br/>or npm test"]
```

