### `/go-test` Command

The Go-specific TDD command enforces Go testing patterns:

```mermaid
graph TB
    GO_TEST["/go-test command"]
    DEFINE["Step 1: Define Types/Interfaces<br/>Scaffold function signatures"]
    TABLE["Step 2: Write Table-Driven Tests<br/>Comprehensive test cases"]
    RUN_RED["Step 3: Run Tests<br/>go test ./... (expect FAIL)"]
    IMPLEMENT["Step 4: Implement Code<br/>Minimal code to pass"]
    RUN_GREEN["Step 5: Run Tests<br/>go test ./... (expect PASS)"]
