| `code-reviewer` | opus | Read, Grep, Glob, Bash | General quality, security, maintainability review |
| `security-reviewer` | opus | Read, Grep, Glob, Bash | Deep vulnerability analysis, OWASP Top 10 compliance |
| `database-reviewer` | sonnet | Read, Grep, Glob, Bash | Database query optimization, Supabase patterns |
| `go-reviewer` | sonnet | Read, Grep, Glob, Bash | Go-specific idioms and best practices |
