## Integration with Development Workflows

### Pre-Commit Review Hook

Add to `.git/hooks/pre-commit`:

```bash
#!/bin/bash
set -e

# Run code review on staged changes
echo "Running code review..."
/code-review

# Check for critical findings in output
if grep -q "## Critical Issues" review-comments.md 2>/dev/null; then
    echo "❌ Critical issues found. Commit blocked."
    exit 1
fi

echo "✅ Code review passed"
```

### PR Automation with GitHub Actions

Example workflow that runs code review on every PR:

```yaml
name: Code Review
on: pull_request

jobs:
  review:
    runs-on: ubuntu-latest
    steps:
      - uses: actions/checkout@v3
      
      - name: Run AgentShield scan
        run: npx ecc-agentshield scan --json > security-report.json
        
      - name: Check security grade
        run: |
          grade=$(jq -r '.grade' security-report.json)
          if [ "$grade" = "D" ] || [ "$grade" = "F" ]; then
            echo "Security grade: $grade (FAILED)"
            exit 1
          fi
          echo "Security grade: $grade (PASSED)"
      
      - name: Run code review
        run: claude -p "Review all changed files in this PR. Report critical issues only."
        
      - name: Comment on PR
        uses: actions/github-script@v6
        with:
          script: |
            const fs = require('fs');
            const report = fs.readFileSync('review-comments.md', 'utf8');
            github.rest.issues.createComment({
              issue_number: context.issue.number,
              owner: context.repo.owner,
              repo: context.repo.repo,
              body: report
            });
```

Sources: [the-shortform-guide.md:238-247]()

### Continuous Claude Integration

In autonomous loops, insert review as a pipeline stage:

```bash
#!/bin/bash
# feature-pipeline.sh

claude -p "Implement feature X with TDD"

# Review pass (separate context)
claude -p "Review all changes. Write findings to review-comments.md"

# Check for blocking issues
if grep -q "## Critical Issues" review-comments.md; then
    # Fix pass (with review context)
    claude -p "Fix all critical issues listed in review-comments.md"
    
    # Re-review
    claude -p "Review changes again. Confirm critical issues resolved."
fi

# Verify build
claude -p "Run full test suite and type check"

# Commit
claude -p "Create conventional commit"
```

Sources: [skills/autonomous-loops/SKILL.md:44-62]()

