### Definition File Template

The eval definition file at `.claude/evals/<feature-name>.md` follows a standardized markdown template with three sections: Capability Evals (checkboxes for new functionality), Regression Evals (checkboxes for preserved behavior), and Success Criteria (threshold definitions).

### Log File Format

Each eval attempt is recorded in `.claude/evals/<feature-name>.log` with timestamp, eval type, name, pass/fail result, and attempt number. This enables calculation of `pass@N` and `pass^N` metrics across multiple runs.

