This page provides deep dives into the internal architectures, optimization strategies, and testing infrastructure that power everything-claude-code. Topics covered include agent delegation patterns, token optimization techniques, memory persistence across sessions, cross-platform utility libraries, package manager detection, project type identification, test suite architecture, and the Plankton code quality system.

