| `getSessionIdShort(fallback)` | Get 8-char session ID | `CLAUDE_SESSION_ID` (last 8 chars) → `getProjectName()` → `fallback` parameter → `'default'` |
| `getProjectName()` | Get project identifier | `getGitRepoName()` → `path.basename(process.cwd())` |
