### File Discovery Functions

**scripts/lib/utils.js:**

| Function | Signature | Returns |
|----------|-----------|---------|
| `findFiles(dir, pattern, opts)` | `(string, string, {maxAge?, recursive?})` | `Array<{path, name, modifiedTime}>` |
