## Test-Driven Development (TDD)

The plugin enforces TDD practices through the `tdd-guide` agent and `tdd-workflow` skill, requiring 80% code coverage [examples/user-CLAUDE.md:79]().

### TDD Cycle

```mermaid
graph LR
    subgraph "Red-Green-Refactor Cycle"
        Red["RED<br/>Write failing test<br/>Define expected behavior"]
        Green["GREEN<br/>Write minimal code<br/>Make test pass"]
        Refactor["REFACTOR<br/>Clean up code<br/>Maintain test pass"]
    end
    
    Red --> Green
    Green --> Refactor
    Refactor --> Red
    
    subgraph "Agent Support"
        TDDGuide["tdd-guide agent<br/>Enforces 80% coverage<br/>Guides test-first"]
        TDDSkill["tdd-workflow skill<br/>Patterns & best practices"]
    end
    
    Red -.uses.-> TDDGuide
    Green -.uses.-> TDDGuide
    Refactor -.uses.-> TDDGuide
    TDDGuide -.references.-> TDDSkill
    
    style Red fill:#f9f9f9
    style Green fill:#f9f9f9
    style Refactor fill:#f9f9f9
```

### TDD Workflow

1. **Write Test First**: Define expected behavior through tests
2. **Run Test (Fail)**: Verify test fails for the right reason
3. **Write Implementation**: Minimal code to make test pass
4. **Run Test (Pass)**: Verify implementation works
5. **Refactor**: Improve code quality while maintaining test pass
6. **Verify Coverage**: Ensure 80% coverage threshold met

**Command**: `/tdd` invokes the `tdd-guide` agent to enforce this workflow.

Sources: [examples/user-CLAUDE.md:78-80]()

