### Native Custom Tools

OpenCode supports native custom tools, not just hook wrappers:

```javascript
// .opencode/tools/run-tests.js
export default {
  name: 'run-tests',
  description: 'Run test suite with coverage',
  schema: { type: 'object', properties: { suite: { type: 'string' } } },
  handler: async ({ suite }) => {
    // Native implementation
  }
}
```

**Sources:** [.opencode/tools/]()

