## Migration Strategies

### Migrating Between Platforms

**Claude Code → Cursor:**

```bash
# Use install.sh with target
./install.sh --target cursor typescript python

# Or manually
cp -r .cursor/rules/* ~/.cursor/rules/
cp .cursor/AGENTS.md ~/.cursor/
cp .cursor/mcp.json ~/.cursor/
```

**Claude Code → OpenCode:**

```bash
# OpenCode auto-detects .opencode/opencode.json
cd everything-claude-code
opencode
```

**Cursor → Claude Code:**

```bash
# Install as plugin
/plugin marketplace add affaan-m/everything-claude-code
/plugin install everything-claude-code@everything-claude-code

# Rules still require manual install
cp -r rules/common/* ~/.claude/rules/
cp -r rules/typescript/* ~/.claude/rules/
```

**Sources:** [README.md:492-545]()

### Multi-Platform Workflow

For teams using multiple platforms:

```bash
# Keep ECC as git submodule
git submodule add https://github.com/affaan-m/everything-claude-code.git .ecc

# Symlink platform configs
ln -s .ecc/.cursor .cursor          # Cursor users
ln -s .ecc/.opencode .opencode      # OpenCode users
ln -s .ecc/.codex .codex            # Codex users

# Claude Code users install as plugin
```

**Sources:** [README.md:1-1060]()

