The plugin version is synchronized across four manifests:

```mermaid
graph TB
    ReleaseScript["scripts/release.sh"]
    
    RootPkg["package.json"]
    PluginJSON[".claude-plugin/plugin.json"]
    MarketJSON[".claude-plugin/marketplace.json"]
    OpenCodePkg[".opencode/package.json"]
    
    ReleaseScript -->|"sed -i version"| RootPkg
    ReleaseScript -->|"sed -i version"| PluginJSON
    ReleaseScript -->|"sed -i version"| MarketJSON
    ReleaseScript -->|"sed -i version"| OpenCodePkg
    
    ReleaseScript -->|"git tag v$VERSION"| Tag["Git Tag"]
    ReleaseScript -->|"git push"| Remote["GitHub Remote"]
```

**Diagram: Version Release Process**

The `scripts/release.sh` script enforces atomic version bumps:

```bash
./scripts/release.sh 1.7.0
# Updates all 4 files, commits, tags, pushes
```

Sources: [scripts/release.sh:1-84](), [package.json:1-97]()

