## Installation Process

### Via NPM Package (Recommended)

```bash
# Install ecc-universal package
npm install ecc-universal

# Run installation script with Cursor target
./node_modules/ecc-universal/install.sh --target cursor typescript

# Or install multiple languages
./node_modules/ecc-universal/install.sh --target cursor typescript python golang
```

The `install.sh` script:
1. Detects the `--target cursor` flag
2. Copies components from `.cursor/` directory instead of root
3. Performs language-specific rule filtering (e.g., only installs `typescript/` rules if specified)
4. Outputs to working directory (Cursor expects project-level `.cursor/` directory)

### Manual Installation

```bash
# Clone repository
git clone https://github.com/affaan-m/everything-claude-code.git

# Copy Cursor-adapted components
cp -r everything-claude-code/.cursor/agents/ .cursor/agents/
cp -r everything-claude-code/.cursor/skills/ .cursor/skills/
cp -r everything-claude-code/.cursor/commands/ .cursor/commands/

# Copy rules (select languages)
mkdir -p .cursor/rules
cp everything-claude-code/.cursor/rules/coding-style.md .cursor/rules/
cp everything-claude-code/.cursor/rules/typescript-*.md .cursor/rules/

# Copy MCP config
cp everything-claude-code/.cursor/mcp/claude_desktop_config.json .cursor/mcp/
```

**Important**: Replace `YOUR_*_HERE` placeholders in MCP configuration with actual API keys.

**Sources**: [docs/ja-JP/README.md:614-623]()

