## Installation Methods

### Method 1: Direct Usage (Recommended)

Clone the repository and run OpenCode from the root directory:

```bash
# Clone repository
git clone https://github.com/affaan-m/everything-claude-code.git
cd everything-claude-code

# Launch OpenCode (auto-detects .opencode/opencode.json)
opencode
```

OpenCode automatically detects and loads the `.opencode/opencode.json` configuration.

### Method 2: NPM Package Installation

For integration into existing projects:

```bash
# Install as dependency
npm install ecc-universal

# Or install globally
npm install -g ecc-universal
```

Then register the plugin in your project's `opencode.json`:

```json
{
  "plugin": ["ecc-universal"]
}
```

### Method 3: Manual Component Copy

For selective component installation:

```bash
# Clone repository
git clone https://github.com/affaan-m/everything-claude-code.git

# Create OpenCode directories
mkdir -p .opencode/agents
mkdir -p .opencode/commands
mkdir -p .opencode/skills
mkdir -p .opencode/tools

# Copy desired components
cp everything-claude-code/.opencode/agents/*.md .opencode/agents/
cp everything-claude-code/.opencode/commands/*.md .opencode/commands/
cp -r everything-claude-code/.opencode/skills/* .opencode/skills/
cp everything-claude-code/.opencode/tools/*.js .opencode/tools/

# Copy configuration
cp everything-claude-code/.opencode/opencode.json .opencode/
```

**Sources**: [docs/ja-JP/README.md:640-730]()

