## Installation and Setup

### Manual Installation

```bash
# Clone repository
git clone https://github.com/affaan-m/everything-claude-code.git
cd everything-claude-code

# Create Codex directories
mkdir -p .codex
mkdir -p .agents/skills

# Copy agents (consolidated format)
# Note: Manual conversion to AGENTS.md required
cat agents/*.md > AGENTS.md

# Copy skills (preserve directory structure)
cp -r skills/* .agents/skills/

# Copy rules (manual integration)
# Note: No native rules support - integrate into custom prompts
cat rules/common/*.md > .codex/custom-rules.md
```

### Configuration Template

Create `.codex/config.toml`:

```toml
[project]
name = "your-project"
language = "typescript"

[defaults]
model = "claude-3-7-sonnet-20250219"
temperature = 0.7

[agent.planner]
description = "Feature implementation planner"
model = "claude-3-7-sonnet-20250219"

[agent.planner.permissions]
filesystem_read = true
filesystem_write = false
bash_execute = false

[agent.code-reviewer]
description = "Code quality reviewer"
model = "claude-opus-4-20250514"

[agent.code-reviewer.permissions]
filesystem_read = true
filesystem_write = false
bash_execute = true

[mcp]
enabled = true
servers = ["filesystem", "github"]
```

### Verification

After setup, verify installation:

```bash
# Check agent definitions
codex agents list

# Check skill availability
codex skills list

# Test agent invocation
codex invoke planner "Add user authentication"
