## Migration from Claude Code

### Step-by-Step Migration

**1. Export current configuration:**

```bash
# From Claude Code project
cd your-project

# Extract agent definitions
mkdir -p codex-export
cat ~/.claude/agents/*.md > codex-export/AGENTS.md

# Copy skills
cp -r ~/.claude/skills codex-export/.agents/skills
```

**2. Convert hooks to commands:**

Identify hook-based automation and document manual equivalents:

```bash
# Create migration guide
cat > codex-export/HOOKS_TO_COMMANDS.md << 'EOF'
# Hook Migration Guide

## PostToolUse Hooks → Manual Commands

| Hook | Command | When to Run |
|------|---------|-------------|
| post-edit-format.js | npx biome format --write . | After edits |
| post-edit-typecheck.js | npx tsc --noEmit | After edits |
| post-edit-console-warn.js | grep -rn "console.log" src/ | Before commits |

## PreToolUse Hooks → Manual Checks

| Hook | Check | When to Run |
|------|-------|-------------|
| git-push-warning | git status | Before push |
| dev-server-tmux | ps aux \| grep "dev server" | Before starting servers |

## Session Hooks → Manual Process

| Hook | Process | When to Run |
|------|---------|-------------|
| session-start.js | Load previous notes | Session start |
| session-end.js | Save session summary | Session end |
EOF
```

**3. Create Codex configuration:**

```bash
# Generate config.toml
cat > .codex/config.toml << 'EOF'
[project]
name = "your-project"
language = "typescript"

[defaults]
model = "claude-3-7-sonnet-20250219"

# Add agent configurations from AGENTS.md
EOF
```

**4. Embed rules in agent prompts:**

```bash
# Prepend rules to each agent section in AGENTS.md
for rule in ~/.claude/rules/*.md; do
  echo "Rule: $(basename $rule)" >> codex-export/embedded-rules.md
  cat "$rule" >> codex-export/embedded-rules.md
  echo "" >> codex-export/embedded-rules.md
done
```

**5. Test migration:**

```bash
# Verify agent invocation
codex agents list

# Test skill loading
codex invoke planner "Implement feature X"

# Confirm permissions
codex permissions check planner
```

### Migration Checklist

- [ ] Export all agents to AGENTS.md
- [ ] Copy skills to .agents/skills/
- [ ] Document hook → command mappings
- [ ] Create config.toml with permissions
- [ ] Embed rules in agent prompts
- [ ] Test agent invocation
- [ ] Test skill loading
- [ ] Create manual workflow aliases
- [ ] Update team documentation
- [ ] Archive Claude Code settings

**Sources**: High-level Diagram 4 (Cross-Platform Distribution Architecture)

