## Summary

Codex CLI integration provides a secure, permission-gated execution environment for ECC components with explicit capability controls. While lacking automated hook-based quality enforcement and continuous learning, Codex offers superior security guarantees through its sandbox model. Teams prioritizing explicit control and auditability over automation convenience should consider Codex as their platform of choice.

For full feature parity including hooks and automatic session management, see [Claude Code Integration](#12.1). For a complete comparison across all platforms, see [Platform Feature Comparison](#12.5).

