## FoundationModels: On-Device LLM

### Overview

The `foundation-models-on-device` skill documents Apple's FoundationModels framework for integrating on-device language models into iOS 26+ apps. All processing happens on-device for privacy and offline support.

| Aspect | Details |
|--------|---------|
| **Skill Name** | `foundation-models-on-device` |
| **File Location** | [skills/foundation-models-on-device/SKILL.md]() |
| **Target Platform** | iOS 26+, requires Apple Intelligence-capable device |
| **Primary Use Cases** | Text generation, structured output extraction, custom tool calling, snapshot streaming |
| **Context Limit** | 4,096 tokens (instructions + prompt + output combined) |
| **Privacy Model** | On-device only, no data leaves device |

**Sources:** [skills/foundation-models-on-device/SKILL.md:1-18]()

