## Usage Scenarios

The skill identifies five primary usage scenarios at [skills/foundation-models-on-device/SKILL.md:238-244]():

1. **On-device text generation** for privacy-sensitive apps
2. **Structured data extraction** from user input (forms, natural language commands)
