## Testing Requirements

All contributions must pass validation tests and include appropriate test coverage. The plugin uses both runtime tests and CI validation scripts to ensure component integrity.

```mermaid
graph TB
    TEST_RUNNER["tests/run-all.js<br/>Master test runner"]
    
    subgraph "Runtime Tests"
        LIB_TESTS["tests/lib/<br/>utils.test.js<br/>package-manager.test.js"]
        
        HOOK_TESTS["tests/hooks/<br/>hooks.test.js"]
    end
    
    subgraph "CI Validation Scripts"
        VALIDATE_AGENTS["scripts/ci/<br/>validate-agents.js<br/>Frontmatter, model, tools"]
        
        VALIDATE_SKILLS["scripts/ci/<br/>validate-skills.js<br/>SKILL.md existence"]
        
        VALIDATE_COMMANDS["scripts/ci/<br/>validate-commands.js<br/>Cross-references"]
        
        VALIDATE_HOOKS["scripts/ci/<br/>validate-hooks.js<br/>JSON schema, inline JS"]
        
        VALIDATE_RULES["scripts/ci/<br/>validate-rules.js<br/>Non-empty files"]
    end
    
    subgraph "Test Infrastructure"
        UTILS["scripts/lib/utils.js"]
        PKG_MGR["scripts/lib/<br/>package-manager.js"]
    end
    
    TEST_RUNNER -->|"runs"| LIB_TESTS
    TEST_RUNNER -->|"runs"| HOOK_TESTS
    
    LIB_TESTS -.->|"tests"| UTILS
    LIB_TESTS -.->|"tests"| PKG_MGR
```

**Running tests:**
```bash
# Run all runtime tests
node tests/run-all.js

# Run specific test suites
node tests/lib/utils.test.js
node tests/lib/package-manager.test.js
node tests/hooks/hooks.test.js

# Run CI validation scripts
