## Purpose and Scope

This page documents general guidelines for contributing to the everything-claude-code repository, including quality standards, naming conventions, testing requirements, and the PR submission process that apply across all contribution types.

For detailed instructions on contributing specific component types, see:
- Agent contributions: [Contributing Agents](#7.1)
- Skills contributions: [Contributing Skills](#7.2)
- Commands contributions: [Contributing Commands](#7.3)
- Hooks contributions: [Contributing Hooks](#7.4)

**Sources:** [CONTRIBUTING.md:1-192]()

## Contribution Process Overview

```mermaid
flowchart TD
