## File Permission Issues

Cross-platform file permission problems and their solutions:

| Platform | Common Issue | File/Path | Solution |
|----------|--------------|-----------|----------|
| Windows | Script not executable | `scripts/hooks/*.js` | Run via `node scripts/hooks/script.js` explicitly |
| macOS/Linux | Permission denied on hook script | `hooks/hooks.json` commands | Add shebang `#!/usr/bin/env node` to `.js` files |
| All | Cannot write observations | `~/.claude/homunculus/observations.jsonl` | Check directory permissions: `chmod -R u+w ~/.claude/homunculus/` |
| All | Cannot read session files | `~/.claude/sessions/*.tmp` | Verify file ownership: `ls -la ~/.claude/sessions/` |

