## Issue 3: Marketplace Addition Failures

### Symptom

```bash
/plugin marketplace add affaan-m/everything-claude-code
# Error: Failed to add marketplace
```

### Common Causes

| Cause | Diagnostic Command | Solution |
|-------|-------------------|----------|
| **Network connectivity** | `curl -I https://github.com` | Check internet connection, verify GitHub is accessible |
| **Invalid repository** | `git ls-remote https://github.com/affaan-m/everything-claude-code` | Verify repository URL is correct |
| **Missing marketplace.json** | `curl https://raw.githubusercontent.com/affaan-m/everything-claude-code/main/.claude-plugin/marketplace.json` | Ensure file exists in repository |
| **Malformed JSON** | `cat .claude-plugin/marketplace.json \| jq .` | Validate JSON syntax with `jq` or online validator |
| **Git access issues** | `git --version` | Install Git: `brew install git` (macOS) or `apt install git` (Linux) |
| **SSH key issues** | `ssh -T git@github.com` | Configure GitHub SSH keys or use HTTPS |

### Manual Configuration Alternative

If marketplace addition continues to fail, manually edit `~/.claude/settings.json`:

```json
{
  "extraKnownMarketplaces": {
    "everything-claude-code": {
      "source": {
        "source": "github",
        "repo": "affaan-m/everything-claude-code"
      }
    }
  },
  "enabledPlugins": {
    "everything-claude-code@everything-claude-code": true
  }
}
```

**File paths:**
- Marketplace metadata: [.claude-plugin/marketplace.json:1-49]()
- Plugin manifest: [.claude-plugin/plugin.json:1-25]()
- User settings: `~/.claude/settings.json`

**Verification after manual configuration:**
```bash
# Restart Claude Code CLI
claude -p

# Verify marketplace is registered
/plugin marketplace list

# Verify plugin is enabled
/plugin list
```

**Sources:** [.claude-plugin/marketplace.json:1-49](), [README.md:335-351]()

