## Issue 5: Manual Installation Path Issues

### Symptom

Manually copied components are not loading or are loaded multiple times.

### Common Path Errors

| Component | Correct Destination | Source Path | Common Mistake |
|-----------|-------------------|-------------|----------------|
| **Agents** | `~/.claude/agents/*.md` | `agents/*.md` | Copied `agents/` directory instead of files |
| **Skills** | `~/.claude/skills/*/SKILL.md` | `skills/*/SKILL.md` | Flattened subdirectory structure |
| **Commands** | `~/.claude/commands/*.md` | `commands/*.md` | Mixed with skills directory |
| **Rules** | `~/.claude/rules/*.md` | `rules/*.md` | Assumed auto-install via plugin |
| **Hooks** | `~/.claude/settings.json` | `hooks/hooks.json` | Copied hooks directory instead of merging config |

### Correct Manual Installation

```bash
# Clone repository
git clone https://github.com/affaan-m/everything-claude-code.git
cd everything-claude-code

# Create directories if they don't exist
mkdir -p ~/.claude/agents
mkdir -p ~/.claude/commands
mkdir -p ~/.claude/skills
mkdir -p ~/.claude/rules

# Install agents (14 files)
cp agents/*.md ~/.claude/agents/
# Installs: planner.md, architect.md, tdd-guide.md, code-reviewer.md, etc.

# Install commands (30+ files)
cp commands/*.md ~/.claude/commands/
# Installs: plan.md, tdd.md, verify.md, checkpoint.md, eval.md, etc.

# Install skills (preserve subdirectory structure)
cp -r skills/* ~/.claude/skills/
# Installs: coding-standards/, tdd-workflow/, search-first/, plankton/, etc.

# Install rules (6 files)
cp rules/*.md ~/.claude/rules/
# Installs: security.md, coding-style.md, testing.md, git-workflow.md, agents.md, performance.md
```

### File Hierarchy Verification

```bash
# Verify correct structure
tree ~/.claude/ -L 2

# Expected output:
# ~/.claude/
# ├── agents/
# │   ├── planner.md
# │   ├── architect.md
# │   └── ...
# ├── commands/
# │   ├── plan.md
# │   ├── tdd.md
# │   └── ...
# ├── skills/
# │   ├── coding-standards/
# │   ├── tdd-workflow/
# │   └── ...
# └── rules/
#     ├── security.md
#     ├── coding-style.md
#     └── ...
```

**Do NOT copy these directories:**
- `.claude-plugin/` - Contains only plugin metadata (`plugin.json`, `marketplace.json`)
- `hooks/` - Configuration should be merged into `~/.claude/settings.json`, not copied
- `mcp-configs/` - Configuration should be merged into `~/.claude.json`, not copied
- `scripts/` - Internal utilities, not part of user installation
- `tests/` - Test suite, not part of user installation

**Sources:** [.claude-plugin/plugin.json:1-25](), [README.md:375-390](), [package.json:40-77]()

