## Complete Installation Verification Checklist

Use this checklist to verify a complete installation. Each check includes the command to run and the expected file count or output.

| Component | Verification Command | Expected Result | File Count |
|-----------|---------------------|-----------------|------------|
| **Plugin installed** | `/plugin list` | Shows `everything-claude-code@everything-claude-code` | N/A |
| **Plugin enabled** | `cat ~/.claude/settings.json \| grep enabledPlugins` | Contains `"everything-claude-code@everything-claude-code": true` | N/A |
| **Commands available** | `/plan "test"` | Executes without "unknown command" error | N/A |
| **Agents loaded** | `ls -1 ~/.claude/agents/ \| wc -l` | 14+ files | 14+ |
| **Agent files** | `ls ~/.claude/agents/` | `planner.md`, `architect.md`, `tdd-guide.md`, `code-reviewer.md`, `security-reviewer.md`, etc. | 14+ |
| **Commands loaded** | `ls -1 ~/.claude/commands/ \| wc -l` | 30+ files | 30+ |
| **Command files** | `ls ~/.claude/commands/` | `plan.md`, `tdd.md`, `verify.md`, `checkpoint.md`, `eval.md`, etc. | 30+ |
| **Skills loaded** | `ls -1 ~/.claude/skills/ \| wc -l` | 28+ directories | 28+ |
| **Skill directories** | `ls ~/.claude/skills/` | `coding-standards/`, `tdd-workflow/`, `search-first/`, `plankton/`, etc. | 28+ |
| **Rules installed** | `ls -1 ~/.claude/rules/ \| wc -l` | 6 files | 6 |
| **Rule files** | `ls ~/.claude/rules/` | `security.md`, `coding-style.md`, `testing.md`, `git-workflow.md`, `agents.md`, `performance.md` | 6 |
| **Hooks configured** | `cat ~/.claude/settings.json \| grep hooks` | Contains hooks array or reference | N/A |
| **MCPs configured** | `cat ~/.claude.json \| grep mcpServers` | Contains mcpServers object (optional) | N/A |
