    end
```

**Key differences:**
- **Marketplace**: Auto-loads agents, commands, skills, hooks (v2.1.0+); requires manual rules and MCP setup
- **Manual**: All components copied explicitly; full control over configuration; no plugin marketplace dependency

**Sources:** [.claude-plugin/plugin.json:1-25](), [.claude-plugin/marketplace.json:1-49](), [README.md:321-368](), [README.md:371-401]()

