## Recovery Procedures

### Complete Uninstall and Reinstall

**Step 1: Backup existing configuration**
```bash
# Backup current settings
cp ~/.claude/settings.json ~/.claude/settings.json.backup
cp ~/.claude.json ~/.claude.json.backup

# Backup any custom rules or hooks
cp -r ~/.claude/rules ~/.claude/rules.backup
```

**Step 2: Uninstall plugin and remove components**
```bash
# Uninstall plugin via marketplace
/plugin uninstall everything-claude-code@everything-claude-code

# Remove manually installed rules
rm -f ~/.claude/rules/security.md
rm -f ~/.claude/rules/coding-style.md
rm -f ~/.claude/rules/testing.md
rm -f ~/.claude/rules/git-workflow.md
rm -f ~/.claude/rules/agents.md
rm -f ~/.claude/rules/performance.md

# Optional: Remove agents, commands, skills if manually installed
# rm -rf ~/.claude/agents/planner.md ~/.claude/agents/architect.md ...
# rm -rf ~/.claude/commands/plan.md ~/.claude/commands/tdd.md ...
# rm -rf ~/.claude/skills/coding-standards/ ~/.claude/skills/tdd-workflow/ ...
```

**Step 3: Clean settings.json (optional)**
```bash
# Edit settings.json to remove plugin entries
# Remove these sections:
# - enabledPlugins."everything-claude-code@everything-claude-code"
# - extraKnownMarketplaces."everything-claude-code"
vim ~/.claude/settings.json
```

**Step 4: Reinstall from marketplace**
```bash
# Add marketplace
/plugin marketplace add affaan-m/everything-claude-code

# Install plugin
/plugin install everything-claude-code@everything-claude-code

# Verify installation
/plugin list
```

**Step 5: Reinstall manual components**
```bash
# Clone repository
git clone https://github.com/affaan-m/everything-claude-code.git
cd everything-claude-code

# Reinstall rules
cp rules/*.md ~/.claude/rules/

# Reinstall MCP configs (if needed)
# Manually merge mcp-configs/mcp-servers.json into ~/.claude.json
```

**Step 6: Verification**
```bash
# Test command execution
/plan "verify installation"

# Check component counts
echo "Agents: $(ls -1 ~/.claude/agents/*.md | wc -l)"
echo "Commands: $(ls -1 ~/.claude/commands/*.md | wc -l)"
echo "Skills: $(ls -1d ~/.claude/skills/*/ | wc -l)"
echo "Rules: $(ls -1 ~/.claude/rules/*.md | wc -l)"
```

### Fallback to Manual Installation

If marketplace installation continues to fail after troubleshooting, use full manual installation:

```bash
# 1. Clone repository
git clone https://github.com/affaan-m/everything-claude-code.git
cd everything-claude-code

# 2. Create directories if needed
mkdir -p ~/.claude/agents
mkdir -p ~/.claude/commands
mkdir -p ~/.claude/skills
mkdir -p ~/.claude/rules

# 3. Copy all component files
# Agents (14+ files)
cp agents/*.md ~/.claude/agents/

# Commands (30+ files)
cp commands/*.md ~/.claude/commands/

# Skills (28+ directories with SKILL.md files)
cp -r skills/* ~/.claude/skills/

# Rules (6 files)
cp rules/*.md ~/.claude/rules/

# 4. Configure hooks in ~/.claude/settings.json
# Open hooks/hooks.json and merge into settings.json "hooks" array
cat hooks/hooks.json
# Then edit:
vim ~/.claude/settings.json

# 5. Configure MCPs in ~/.claude.json (optional)
# Open mcp-configs/mcp-servers.json for reference
cat mcp-configs/mcp-servers.json
# Then edit:
vim ~/.claude.json
# Merge mcpServers and replace API key placeholders

# 6. Verification
ls ~/.claude/agents/*.md | wc -l       # Should be 14+
ls ~/.claude/commands/*.md | wc -l     # Should be 30+
ls -d ~/.claude/skills/*/ | wc -l      # Should be 28+
ls ~/.claude/rules/*.md | wc -l        # Should be 6
```

**Manual hooks configuration format:**
```json
{
  "hooks": [
    {
      "event": "PreToolUse",
      "script": "path/to/hook.js",
      "args": []
    }
  ]
}
```

**Note:** For hooks configuration, see page 6 (Hooks System) for complete hook setup details.

**Sources:** [.claude-plugin/plugin.json:1-25](), [README.md:371-401](), [package.json:40-77]()

