## Common Error Messages

| Error Message | Root Cause | Diagnostic Command | Solution |
|--------------|-----------|-------------------|----------|
| `Duplicate hooks file detected: ./hooks/hooks.json` | Claude Code v2.1+ auto-discovers `hooks/hooks.json`, but `.claude-plugin/plugin.json` also declares it | `cat .claude-plugin/plugin.json \| grep hooks` | Remove `"hooks"` field from `plugin.json` and re-install |
| `Plugin not found in marketplace: everything-claude-code` | Marketplace not added or repository URL incorrect | `/plugin marketplace list` | Run `/plugin marketplace add affaan-m/everything-claude-code` |
| `Unknown command: /plan` | Plugin not installed, not enabled, or commands not loaded | `/plugin list` | Check `enabledPlugins` in `~/.claude/settings.json` |
| `Failed to load plugin manifest` | Malformed JSON in `.claude-plugin/plugin.json` | `cat .claude-plugin/plugin.json \| jq .` | Fix JSON syntax errors |
| `Permission denied: ~/.claude/agents/` | Insufficient file system permissions | `ls -ld ~/.claude/` | `chmod 755 ~/.claude/ && mkdir -p ~/.claude/agents` |
| `Command not found: claude` | Claude Code CLI not installed or not in PATH | `which claude` | Install Claude Code CLI from anthropic.com |
| `Error: Cannot read property 'version' of undefined` | Missing `version` field in `plugin.json` | `cat .claude-plugin/plugin.json \| grep version` | Ensure `plugin.json` has valid `"version"` field |
| `Git error: Repository not found` | Incorrect repository URL or network issue | `git ls-remote https://github.com/affaan-m/everything-claude-code` | Verify network and repository URL |
| `/plugin install fails silently` | Claude Code CLI version < v2.1.0 | `claude --version` | Upgrade to Claude Code v2.1.0+ |

**Sources:** [.claude-plugin/plugin.json:1-25](), [.claude-plugin/marketplace.json:1-49](), [README.md:296-318]()

