### Session Directory Permissions Issue

**Platform-Specific Checks:**

| Platform | Directory Path | Required Permissions | Fix Command |
|----------|---------------|---------------------|-------------|
| macOS/Linux | `~/.claude/sessions/` | `drwxr-xr-x` (755) | `chmod -R 755 ~/.claude` |
| Windows | `%USERPROFILE%\.claude\sessions\` | Full Control | `icacls "%USERPROFILE%\.claude" /grant %USERNAME%:F /T` |

**Verification:**

```bash
# Unix-like systems
ls -ld ~/.claude/sessions/
# Should show: drwxr-xr-x ... .claude/sessions/

# Test write
touch ~/.claude/sessions/.test && rm ~/.claude/sessions/.test && echo "Writable" || echo "Not writable"

# Test read
ls ~/.claude/sessions/ >/dev/null && echo "Readable" || echo "Not readable"
```

**Sources:** [scripts/lib/utils.js:50-100](), [tests/lib/utils.test.js:80-88]()

