## Known Limitations and Workarounds

### Filename Validation Strictness

**Session Filename Requirements:**

```mermaid
graph LR
    Filename["YYYY-MM-DD-shortid-session.tmp"]
    
    subgraph "Validation Rules"
        DateFormat["YYYY: 4 digits<br/>MM: 01-12<br/>DD: 01-31<br/>Calendar-accurate"]
        ShortIdFormat["shortid:<br/>8+ chars<br/>lowercase alphanumeric<br/>[a-z0-9]+"]
        Suffix["Ends with:<br/>-session.tmp"]
    end
    
    Filename --> DateFormat
    Filename --> ShortIdFormat
    Filename --> Suffix
    
    DateFormat --> Valid
    ShortIdFormat --> Valid
    Suffix --> Valid
    
    Valid["parseSessionFilename()<br/>returns {date, shortId,<br/>filename, datetime}"]
```

**Sources:** [scripts/lib/session-manager.js:50-120](), [tests/lib/session-manager.test.js:48-654]()

**Rejected Patterns:**

| Pattern | Reason | Test Case |
|---------|--------|-----------|
| `2026-02-31-abc12345-session.tmp` | Feb has 28/29 days | [tests/lib/session-manager.test.js:617-620]() |
| `2026-04-31-abc12345-session.tmp` | April has 30 days | [tests/lib/session-manager.test.js:622-625]() |
| `2026-02-29-abc12345-session.tmp` (2025) | 2025 not leap year | [tests/lib/session-manager.test.js:627-630]() |
| `2026-00-15-abc12345-session.tmp` | Month cannot be 00 | [tests/lib/session-manager.test.js:601-604]() |
| `2026-01-00-abc12345-session.tmp` | Day cannot be 00 | [tests/lib/session-manager.test.js:606-609]() |
| `2026-02-01-ABC12345-session.tmp` | Uppercase in shortId | [tests/lib/session-manager.test.js:581-584]() |
| `2026-02-01-abc-session.tmp` | shortId < 8 chars | [tests/lib/session-manager.test.js:83-86]() |

**Workaround for Manual Session Files:**

Use the old format without short ID for manually created sessions:
```
2026-02-11-session.tmp  # Valid: old format (no shortId)
```

This is parsed with `shortId = 'no-id'` at [scripts/lib/session-manager.js:85-90]().

**Sources:** [tests/lib/session-manager.test.js:51-654](), [scripts/lib/session-manager.js:50-120]()

